                                                "sense_id": "77d31630-7b5b-3849-aa19-547438fab319",
                                                "text": "Rebuffed by the Arabs and then the Iranians for trying to be part of them and their societies, Pakistan is just a hotchpotch salad of people supposedly bound together by the myth of Muslim 'Ummah'."
